## Model Autopilot — Cursor

When `.project-ai/MODEL_AUTOPILOT.yaml` has `enabled: true`, follow one step per chat and emit the **STOP — SWITCH MODEL NOW** banner when the step is done. Picker labels below are specific to **Cursor** (`ide: cursor`).

**Picker location:** Top of chat panel — model menu (MAX Mode)
**Last verified:** 2026-05-19

> **Caveats**
> - MAX Mode picker varies by Cursor plan (Free vs Pro vs Ultra).
> - Auto = Cursor router; treated as fast tier — not for implementation steps.
> - Composer is Cursor-proprietary (fast family).

